expect verb=recipes text=storagedelight: n=([5-9]\d|\d{3,}) 
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=\S+ done=0
look recipe count at least the 50 new rows (36 stone countertops and 14 bamboo blocks: the countertop and bamboo reg counts); a different block count than 140: record it against storage_delight.md 5
## SQ-STD-02 | Storage Delight drawer and cabinets: 27 slots, dropped with contents (x 100..104; queue group B)
@group B
@commands `/give` and place a `storagedelight:bamboo_drawer`, a `storagedelight:oak_cabinet_with_polished_tuff_countertop` and a `storagedelight:warped_cabinet_with_stone_bricks_countertop`; open and close each, break with an axe
@pass Opens as 27 slots, no block entity error, item kept and dropped
@fails Depends on: repackedStorage jar
